{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Plunge》是一款以自由落體為主題的單指操作手機遊戲，玩家由高空躍下，穿越城市陽台與晾衣繩、鑽入下水道與地鐵、掠過巖漿與地核，直墮地球另一端再衝出太空。適合喜歡短時間反覆挑戰、追求深度紀錄與高分評價的玩家。原價 US $2.99，現正終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，內購限時免費中。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-247.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>真實重力自由落體</h2>\n<p>遊戲以真實 9.81 m/s² 重力計算下落，按住畫面收身俯衝加速，放手張開身體減速，速度隨深度遞增並即時顯示。玩家可傾斜手機或單指拖曳轉向，貼近障礙物可累積擦身連擊，開傘越晚評級越高。護盾、時間減速與縮小道具各有用途，每局三項任務完成可獲星星，並由新手逐步晉升至太空人。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-307-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-308-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-309-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-310-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-311-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-312-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Plunge: Skydiving Jump Game 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Plunge: Skydiving Jump Game</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/plunge-skydiving-jump-game/id6820654658\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T17:44:24.292206+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":462,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T17:34:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:17:58.075156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T17:37:42.703587+00:00","content_hash":"8d51afd59b1702dbde1e1cd244dc04852bca605de02c9bcda26d78ac0cac71d4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}